# Cloudflare Zero Trust tunnel token for clickgraft.elusive.net.
#
# Create the tunnel in the Cloudflare dashboard (Zero Trust > Networks >
# Tunnels), add a public hostname clickgraft.elusive.net -> http://web:80,
# and paste the connector token here. The real value lives only in
# /opt/clickgraft/.env on the CT and is never committed or copied off it.
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=
